     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\">Hi, </font><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">I trying to deploy over the web on Shiny Server with &quot;Self-hosted Shiny Server&quot; Option.</font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">I am on Ubuntu 12.04 and I made all <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\">instructions for installing Shiny Server and its prerequisites on Ubuntu given on the web site.<br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\"><font size=\"2\">Everthing seems to be ok : on my local computer, I have access to the examples with this URL : http://&lt;hostname&gt;:3838/examples/ but it&#39;s not the case from an other computer.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\"><font size=\"2\">What configuration I must doing in addition ? <br></font><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\">Thanks</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\">Elodie</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:25px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px\"><br></span></di